            "parameters": {
                "content": "## [WF-01c-v3] Present to Brett\n\nKNOWN BUG: All articles from NYTimes.\nCause: Curated via SQL ORDER BY score (no diversity).\nWF-01b diversity logic works but Mark Curated fails.\nFIX: Fix WF-01b Mark Curated, then diversity kicks in.\n\nKNOWN BUG: Footer category button emojis render as escape codes\nin some Telegram clients. Need actual Unicode in button text.\n\nSTATUS: Morning intro (LLM), article cards, footer all work.\nMark Presented works. Multi-chat works.",
